WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Intake forms. Public forms anyone can fill in without an account; each response becomes a task.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Use it for: bug reports; design requests.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:15.000
Someone fills in the public form → Answers are checked → A task is created with your defaults → Automations and webhooks run

4
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:22.500
Open Forms from the project header.

5
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:35.320
Create a form…

6
00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:41.880
Its first question becomes the task title.

7
00:00:41.880 --> 00:01:06.180
Add more questions…

8
00:01:06.180 --> 00:01:22.880
…and defaults for the tasks it creates.

9
00:01:22.880 --> 00:01:33.230
Anyone with the link can respond — no account needed.

10
00:01:33.230 --> 00:01:40.780
Send…

11
00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:46.730
…and the response is a task in the project, high priority.

12
00:01:46.730 --> 00:01:52.730
The link says Not found: The form was closed or deleted. “Too many tries”: The per-address limit was reached; try again in an hour.

13
00:01:52.730 --> 00:01:57.230
No account needed to respond
